# Verani Wrangler Config

## DO Bindings

`class_name` in `durable_objects.bindings` **must** match the exported class name from the worker entry point.

**Active DOs:** `UserConnection`, `PresenceRoom`, `ChatRoom`

Remove any stale bindings (e.g. `CounterActor`, `ChatExample`, `PresenceExample`, `NotificationsExample`) or `wrangler dev` will fail.

## Example

```jsonc
{
  "durable_objects": {
    "bindings": [
      { "class_name": "UserConnection", "name": "CONNECTION_DO" },
      { "class_name": "PresenceRoom", "name": "PRESENCE_ROOM" },
      { "class_name": "ChatRoom", "name": "CHAT_ROOM" }
    ]
  }
}
```

## Migrations

`new_sqlite_classes` must list the same DO class names.
